ng to consistently hold the sprint button.Weapons:Increased Mortis shotgun reload speed further by 25%.Increased Bitey's primary fire damage.Increased Shdredder Damage further by ~15%.Movement and slide reworked:The camera ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:23:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036185","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:59:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4438400-1846651706687997","game_id":"steam-4438400","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1","summary":"Demo update 1:1: Re-bindable controls for keyboard.2: Controller support, re-bindable controls for controller. \\Experimental!] 3. Weapon wheel moved from T to X (or middle mouse).4. Tutorial cards show the keys actually in use in the settings, while detecting if you are using a keyboard or controller in the menus.5. New shotgun sound, shotgun reloads 15% faster.6. Cigar: Damage resistance increased from 40% to 55%, absorbed damage now reflected at the attacker.7. Shredder muzzle flash toned down","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T20:55:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687997","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:07:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4438400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4438400":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4438400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z"},"5200210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:40Z","statu